#40300
A Tower of Obsidian~
   A narrow bridge projects from this spire of black rock, spanning over the
rivers of lava that churn below, making it impossible to proceed there, even
with flight, the waves of heat would sear the skin of a dragon.  A pair of huge
obsidian valves are set in the northeastern wall of the spire, locked, barred
and covered in intricate runes which are indecipherable.  Heat radiates from
their surface, and a series of glowing red runes are an indication that magical
wards may be in place here too.  What is most disconcerting about these portals
is that they are nearly thirty feet in height.    
~
