#40305
The Hall of Fire~
   The floor changes here, from black obsidian to a reddish rock, which seems
to shimmer with heat.  The highly polished walls are lined with massive
pillars, anthropomorphic representations of muscled dwarves, seeming to strain
under the weight of the ceiling they support.  Gouts of flame, ignited gases,
burst from hidden spaces in the wall at sporadic intervals, bathing the hall in
a strange reddish glow.  The temperature is almost unbearable.    
~
