wall mosaic~
   Several famous battles in fire giant history are recorded here, including a
biased retelling of the siege that wrested the Silver Duchess mines from their
rightful owners.  There is a palpable sense of cruelty in each mosaic, however,
the fire giants are renowned for their mistreatment of all races.    
~
