#40308
The Audience Chamber~
   Five iron statues flank the broad white-veined marble dais that the hall
rises to meet here.  Mosaics cover each wall, as well as the high ceiling,
though these are obscured by two more iron chandeliers.  A flaming skull
flanked by iron cressets hangs suspended behind a throne of truly enormous
proportions.  Waves of heat radiate from this skull, bathing the inhabitants of
this chamber in its warmth.  Several skeletons are nailed to open spaces on the
walls, scraps of flesh still hanging from their bones.  Flickering light from
burning gases casts a ghastly illumination on these rotting remains.    
~
