#40309
A Hidden Room~
   A narrow rough hewn tunnel has been carved through the rock, linking several
passages of importance to the King.  He uses this narrow edit to access them
without being seen by his kind, or enemies.  A narrow stone shelf, devoid of
contents, lines the north wall, while a dusty statue of a fire giant leans
against the eastern wall.  A dim outline of a door can be made out in the
southern wall.    
~
