A Small Cave~
   The secret door opens onto a small cave, boasting only a single exit, a
winding passage to the west, other than the shelf.  There is no light in this
musty cavern, nor is there any sound.  If anything lairs in the rocky darkness,
it is loathe to reveal its presence.  Dried bones crunch underfoot here,
evidence of the fate of previous unfortunates.    
