#40314
The Queens Chambers~
   The rooms that lay beyond the odd door house the Queen and her large
retinue, who wait on her hand and foot.  The King apparently prefers to quarter
elsewhere, for there is no sign that he has had a hand in the decor of this
place, though it does share his taste for the vulgar and garish.  Lewd
tapestries depicting giantesses coupling with a wide variety of species
decorate the walls, inducing queasiness in those who regard them, though a
troll may find some of the giantesses of some interest.  Open passages lead
north and west.    
~
