#40316
A Crowded Chamber~
   Frupy is a demanding, spoiled giant, and as such has a large retinue of
servants on hand at all times.  The King prefers to keep his wife's whims
satisfied, for she is wont to terribly explosive bouts of rage.  This chamber
is filled with piles of furs that serve as bedding for the many maidservants,
and the walls boast the garish wall hangings that by now you have almost grown
inured to, though an artisan would balk at having to confront such an
incompetent waste of material.    
~
