#40321
A Disturbing Odor~
   Wafting in from a large chamber to the south is a smell that you are well
accustomed to, the stench of burning flesh.  This flesh, however, is not
burning on the funeral pyre, or the battlefield, but over a hot fire, and is
due to serve the giants as their next meal.  Several humanoid races are
considered delicacies by this brutal race, most especially halflings and of
course their natural enemy dwarves.  The door to the north presumably leads to
the pantry, though you balk at what you may find in there.    
~
