#40331
The Advisor's Study~
   This small chamber boasts a desk, covered in maps and papers, and a high
chair, enabling someone of lesser height than the table was initially designed
for the opportunity to reach what lies atop it.  A second chair, sized for a
giant, rests near the desk, as if whoever sat there wished to observe the work
in progress on the desk.  Cases laden with giantish documents line the walls,
while several plaques in dwarven also can be seen, most of them carved with
messages that are meant to inspire effort and elicit greater results.  These
simple motivational items would be of no use to a giant as few indeed know the
dwarven tongue.  Who, then, works here?    
~
