A Comfortable Lounge~
   This opulent chamber is the epitomy of comfort, plush chairs and sofas with
footstools of fine cloth surround low cedar tables piled high with fresh fruit
and sweetmeats in burnished metal bowls.  The walls are lined with elven
tapestries, of fine quality, and the ceiling is obscured by translucent cloths,
through which a dim light is pleasantly diffused about the chamber.  The entire
scene is quite relaxing, though there is also a faint but definite feeling of
something awry at work here.    
