The Chimera Guard~
   This small chamber contains enough weapons to arm a small army.  Spears,
swords, axes, mattocks and pole arms line the walls, all giant sized of course,
and of little use to you.  Shield of iron and cured hide rest nearby, the
smallest taller than a male human.  Chests piled with smaller hand weapons
taken from opponents rest to either side of the twin iron doors that bar the
exits from this room to the north and south.  Whoever stocked this room has
prepared for a serious confrontation indeed!    
~
