towards the center of the citadel.  Shouts and cries of mirth and anger echo
all about you, the sound echoed and amplified by the odd acoustics in these
obsidian halls.  Doubtless there is a large number of giants quartered nearby,
however, off duty soldiers resting in between stints of guard duties or raids
on human settlements.    
