sorts, scattered with toys as large as weapons, and most likely as deadly if
hurled at someone, as they are made of iron and stone.  The giants are raised
hard, violence and strife are taught them from a young age.  Youngsters are
actively encouraged to do battle with each other, and even serious injuries are
overlooked, as only the strongest will prevail.    
