The Engineers' Hall~
   This room is well furnished, with several cots, chests and a low table, as
well as a large number of boulders, stacked next to cases of wine and barrels
of giantish ale.  Sacks filled with dried meat lie next to the table,
indicating that whoever lives here does not share the fire giant's taste for
fresh prey.  Little of it, however, appears to have been eaten.  Most of the
items in this chamber are far too heavy for a human to even budge, a troll
would have to strain to lift one of the boulders.    
~
