A Crowded Chamber~
   This chamber is piled with hastily assembled supplies, including sacks of
dried meat, heaps of skins, rolled tapestries and broken wooden furniture.  It
looks like someone has evacuated into this chamber from their regular dwelling,
which is precisely what happened, for when the Steading of Nosnra was stormed
by adventurers, the survivors fled here, bringing word of the fall of their
stronghold.    
