#40387
A Stinking Hall~
   The strong smell of decay mingled with the naturally offensive odor of
trolls is almost overpowering here, and is a strong motivation to not continue.
Trolls are used as strongarms and thugs by a variety of races, for the very
good reason that they can rend most other foes to pieces with little effort,
their powerful bodies possessing unearthly strength and ferocity.    
~
