#40388
The Guard Post~
   Stationed here are the ferocious trolls whose duty it is to keep the gnolls
penned to the north and south from escaping, not a difficult task for these
beasts as the gnolls are terrified of them.  A pile of stinking meat adds to
their nauseating odor, as do various other bits and scraps of creatures.  A
pile of weapons of little worth is used to arm the gnolls in times of
emergency, though if the truth be known their natural weaponry are far more
effective.    
~
