#40389
The Thrall Pen~
   Piles of straw covered with hide serve as beds for the gnoll slaves that are
quartered here, kept as servants of the giants.  They are unwilling servants,
but are terrified of the trolls and thus most are obedient.  The odor here,
while bad, is nowhere near as awful as the odor of their guardians.    
~
