#40390
The Thrall Pen~
   This long corridor is lined with piles of straw and stained animal hides,
stretching into the distance to the northwest.  The bulk of the gnolls who
serve the fire giants are quartered here, in these filthy conditions, though
they are terrified into submission by the horrid guards that the giants employ.
  
~
