#40392
The Cells~
   The cells along this section of the corridor appear to be larger than those
to the west, though not by much.  The smell is still unbearable, and the cries
for help equally loud.  The floor here bears pools of blood, a prisoner was
recently bludgeoned to death when refusing to enter his cell peacefully.    
~
