#40395
The Cells~
   The dark corridor continues, passing more dens of misery and despair.  It is
hard to decide what is worse, the abominable smells or the unearthly cries of
agony and wails of terror, that assault the ears of those who pass.  Those kept
here cannot possibly hope to ever be free, the best they can expect is a quick
death.  An unlikely fate in the company of giants...    
~
