#40398
The End of the Corridor~
   The corridor ends here, before two doors that are, unlike most of the cell
doors, crafted from metal, in this case a black alloy of a type that is not
familiar to most races, for it is forged only in the dark lairs of subterranean
races such as the Duergar and Drow.  This super hard adamantium is also used in
the manufacture of weapons and armor by the dark folk.    
~
